---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure | Software Decision Guide">
  <main class="site-container py-32">
    <h1 class="mb-6 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-brand text-primary">
      Affiliate Disclosure
    </h1>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
      <p>
        Software Decision Guide may earn commissions when users click links or sign up for recommended software products.
      </p>

      <p>
        Recommendations are based on stated needs, decision criteria, product fit, and implementation considerations. Affiliate relationships may influence which products are available to link to, but they do not replace the decision logic of the guide.
      </p>

      <p>
        Sponsored placements or affiliate links, when used, should be clearly labeled.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>